OL,3,GNEWSAMotion of no-confidence in Sinn
OL,4,AFein ministers 'pointless' - O'Neill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe First Minister Michelle O'Neill has
OL,7,Fdismissed as "pointless" a motion of
OL,8,Fno-confidence in her and three other
OL,9,FSinn Fein ministers.
OL,11,FThe Northern Ireland Assembly has
OL,12,Fstarted debating the no-confidence
OL,13,Fmotions over the ministers' handling of
OL,14,Fthe Drumcree dispute, after they
OL,15,Freceived the backing of unionist
OL,16,Fparties last week.
OL,18,FHowever, the attempt to oust them will
OL,19,Ffail as it requires cross-community
OL,20,Fsupport from a majority of both
OL,21,Funionists and nationalists in the
OL,22,Fassembly.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
